                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Its a very.. unique game tbh. The game is broken into 2 parts, the first is your basic dating sim figuring out which girl you like an getting to know them etc. The second part is based of your choices then goes into a post-apocalyptic setting. Now the games not perfect but it is something to read and i did enjoy the routes. \n\nThere is no route order IMO as they all kinda spoil the other. I would do the other girls first then 1. Yuno 2. Akira 3. Kanon. Akira and Kannons story really spoil it so save them for last cause they get more into details about whats going on but that's just me.\n\nAs always guys do your research before you buy to make sure your mildly interested as this kind of setting/twist might not be up your alley.",
